{{!-- context: recipientName, platformName, brandName, packageName, orderId, revisionsAdded, maxRevisions, actionUrl --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}}, 👋</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">More revisions purchased 🔁</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  <strong>{{brandName}}</strong> bought <strong>{{revisionsAdded}}</strong> extra revision(s) on your order for <strong>"{{packageName}}"</strong>. It's a good sign — they're invested in getting this just right.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#374151;">
  This order now allows up to <strong>{{maxRevisions}}</strong> revisions in total. They may request another one — keep an eye out for their feedback.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 24px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="View order →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">— The {{platformName}} team ✨</p>
